OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to 'remarkable' Dame
OL,4,AEsther Rantzen
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have come in from across the
OL,7,FSouth to the "remarkable" broadcaster
OL,8,Fand campaigner Dame Esther Rantzen,
OL,9,Fwhose death at the age of 86 was
OL,10,Fannounced on Wednesday.
OL,12,FShe was best known for presenting the
OL,13,FBBC TV programme That's Life! for more
OL,14,Fthan two decades, as well as for
OL,15,Fsetting up the charity Childline.
OL,17,FIn her later years, the legendary
OL,18,Fbroadcaster permanently relocated from
OL,19,Fthe capital to her cottage in Bramshaw
OL,20,Fin the New Forest, Hampshire.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
