OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to 'remarkable' Dame
OL,4,AEsther Rantzen
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal Conservative MP Sir Julian Lewis
OL,7,Fhad struck up a regular correspondence
OL,8,Fwith his constituent over recent years.
OL,9,FHe said Dame Esther had been "an
OL,10,Fabsolutely scintillating, glittering
OL,11,Fand unforgettable personality".
